        "id": "E0",
        "kind": "feed",
        "text": "Meta is introducing Muse Wonder and Muse Wonder Full, our most capable models to date, built to deliver state-of-the-art performance on personal and professional agentic tasks. The post Introducing Muse Wonder and Muse Wonder Full: Frontier Models for Agents appeared first on Meta Newsroom .",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/10/introducing-muse-wonder-models/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-12T17:08:05.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-15T09:06:31.809Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E1",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Introducing Muse Wonder and Muse Wonder Full: Frontier Models for Agents",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/10/introducing-muse-wonder-models/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-12T17:08:05.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-15T09:06:31.809Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E2",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Meta is introducing Muse Wonder and Muse Wonder Full, our most capable models to date, built to deliver state-of-the-art performance on personal and professional agentic tasks — from navigating an insurance claim to making sense of a lease to building a working app.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/10/introducing-muse-wonder-models/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-12T17:08:05.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-15T09:06:31.809Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Muse Wonder is available today for developers and builders through the Meta Model API and Muse Code while Muse Wonder Full is available today for Muse Code subscribers.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/10/introducing-muse-wonder-models/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-12T17:08:05.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-15T09:06:31.809Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Muse Wonder will soon power experiences in Muse , and will roll out first to subscribers.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/10/introducing-muse-wonder-models/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-12T17:08:05.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-15T09:06:31.809Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Fourteen months ago, we began an overhaul of our AI efforts, and in that time we’ve gone from rebuilding our foundations to pushing the frontier.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/10/introducing-muse-wonder-models/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-12T17:08:05.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-15T09:06:31.809Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Today, Meta is introducing the Muse Wonder series with Muse Wonder and Muse Wonder Full, our most capable models to date, built on the groundwork we laid with Muse Spark .",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/10/introducing-muse-wonder-models/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-12T17:08:05.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-15T09:06:31.809Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Muse Wonder and Muse Wonder Full bring that capability to expert domains including law, finance, and health, along with frontier coding performance for people building everything from a game to an app for a new business.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/10/introducing-muse-wonder-models/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-12T17:08:05.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-15T09:06:31.809Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "That’s why we trained the Muse Wonder family to avoid sharing private information without permission; turn down requests to assist in performing actually harmful acts; and work to improve security and strengthen defenses against cyber attacks.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/10/introducing-muse-wonder-models/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-12T17:08:05.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-15T09:06:31.809Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Developers and security teams can use models like Muse Wonder to find flaws in their own code and strengthen their systems, so we made sure the models can still do that work.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/10/introducing-muse-wonder-models/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-12T17:08:05.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-15T09:06:31.809Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "A full report with additional safety evaluations will be available soon.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/10/introducing-muse-wonder-models/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-12T17:08:05.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-15T09:06:31.809Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Muse Wonder is available today through the Meta Model API and Muse Code.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/10/introducing-muse-wonder-models/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-12T17:08:05.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-15T09:06:31.809Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E12",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "It will soon power more of Muse , rolling out first to subscribers.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/10/introducing-muse-wonder-models/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-12T17:08:05.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-15T09:06:31.809Z"
      }
